&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A structured onboarding program to ensure a successful start.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A competitive compensation package.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;30 days of annual leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Subsidized Germany Ticket (Deutschlandticket).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Company pension scheme.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discounted fitness memberships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;High-quality personal protective equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regular team events and many additional employee benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Hungry for More?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Then we&#39;d love to hear from you! Please submit your application &lt;strong&gt;without a photo and without providing information about your nationality, gender, or other personal characteristics.&lt;/strong&gt; You are, of course, welcome to voluntarily include language certificates as well as proof of your residence and work permit.&lt;/p&gt;
