&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artefact&lt;/strong&gt;, a global AI and data consulting company with rapid growth, is looking for a creative and tech-savvy &lt;strong&gt;Senior AI Engineer (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt; to join the tech team full-time. Ideally, you are &lt;strong&gt;located in Hamburg, Munich, Berlin&lt;/strong&gt; or nearby - but if you&#39;re based elsewhere in Germany and a great fit, we would still love to hear from you. Could this be you?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our data &amp;amp; AI experts develop production-ready, scalable solutions that bring real business value to our clients. You’ll work in interdisciplinary teams of data scientists, engineers, analysts and consultants to shape the future of data- and AI-driven products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll help identify business needs, explore data and AI use cases, and drive projects from idea to production - whether it’s a proof-of-concept or a scalable solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll own your work end-to-end - from concept and architecture to implementation, optimization, and delivery. You design smart, robust solutions using data or LLMs and other AI technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Train.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll stay ahead of the curve - experimenting with new models, prompt engineering, fine-tuning, and tools. You’ll also share your knowledge within the team and benefit from our partners’ training offers (Google, AWS, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work closely with clients, product owners, and non-technical stakeholders, balancing technical excellence with practical business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gain broad experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on 1-3 projects per year across different industries and use cases - from customer service automation to knowledge management and internal tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build real-world data and AI applications using modern tools like LangChain, PydanticAI, MCP servers, RAG pipelines, vector databases (e.g. FAISS, Weaviate), LlamaIndex, Vertex AI, OpenAI APIs, and Hugging Face models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape the way clients use data and AI, driving innovation and best practices in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious &amp;amp; forward-thinking.&lt;/strong&gt; You are passionate about solving complex problems using cutting-edge AI and data technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on.&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience with LLMs (e.g. OpenAI, Claude, Gemini, LLaMA), prompt engineering, API integration, and ML frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Holistic.&lt;/strong&gt; You understand the full ML lifecycle, including data preparation, model deployment, evaluation, and monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicative.&lt;/strong&gt; You can break down technical concepts for diverse audiences in English and ideally in German as well.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supportive.&lt;/strong&gt; You coach junior team members, provide constructive feedback, and actively contribute to our culture of learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree&lt;/strong&gt; in computer science, AI, data science or similar field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;3+ years of experience in machine learning or AI engineering, with hands-on AI projects in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python and cloud-based AI services (GCP, AWS, or Azure).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of data analysis/engineering and AI-specific components like RAG, prompt design, fine-tuning, embeddings, and model evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with DevOps and ML-Ops best practices (Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, a sense of ownership, and a structured approach to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages&lt;/strong&gt;: Business-fluent German and English (both written and spoken) are mandatory to participate in client workshops and deliver polished presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility&lt;/strong&gt;: A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why ARTEFACT?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging projects&lt;/strong&gt; with national and international clients across industries (e.g. L’Oréal, Samsung, Allianz, Sanofi).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diverse career paths&lt;/strong&gt;, promotions based on your performance - not tenure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong team culture&lt;/strong&gt; and real collaboration across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal development&lt;/strong&gt; through workshops, certifications, coaching, and access to partner programs (Google, AWS, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Attractive benefits&lt;/strong&gt;: hybrid work, flexible hours, 1 additional day off for your birthday, Christmas &amp;amp; New Year&#39;s Eve off, mental health support, 4 weeks of workation, corporate benefits, office brunch, team events, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Let’s shape the future of AI - together!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else. If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Artefact &lt;/strong&gt;is a global consulting company specializing in data and AI services, headquartered in Paris. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global market leaders. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions. Artefact is dedicated to leveraging data and AI to enhance organizations and their people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Curious to learn more? Reach out to us -----<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who/What is Artefact?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artefact is a next-generation strategy and data consulting firm dedicated to transforming organizations through data and AI. We combine the rigor of top-tier strategy consulting with deep expertise in data, digital, and analytics to help clients achieve tangible business impact. With 2,000+ consultants, data scientists, and engineers across 26 countries, we work with global leaders such as Samsung, L’Oréal, Orange, and Sanofi. At our German offices, we are on a rapid growth trajectory, advising leading national and international clients cross-industry on how to unlock the full potential of their data, build scalable data architectures, and implement cutting-edge AI solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, you will act as a trusted sparring partner to executives, steer complex transformation programs across functions, and drive organizational change at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead AI Transformation Programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Steer end-to-end execution of enterprise-level AI transformations. Identify internal champions, navigate corporate politics, manage structural blockers, and drive measurable user adoption and organizational change.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; AI Use Case Scoping:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with C-level stakeholders to answer high-stakes questions: How can AI reshape their business models? How should they govern data? You don&#39;t just advise; you help evaluate model choices, discuss data privacy trade-offs, and conceptualize technical feasibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Business Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively drive the growth of our German practice. Take ownership in lead generation and pipeline conversion by engaging prospective clients, shaping proposals, and leading pre-sales and key-account expansion initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Artefact&#39;s AI Transformation perspective externally. Advance our voice in enterprise AI through expert discussions, content creation (e.g. LinkedIn, whitepapers), and opinionated, hands-on perspectives on applied AI trends and real-world adoption pathways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance the Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Evolve our methodologies, tools, and frameworks to keep our offering state-of-the-art. Develop reusable transformation playbooks and bring your strategic consulting or technology expertise into the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Mentoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a senior advisor and role model - leading, coaching, and mentoring agile, hybrid project teams (consultants, data scientists, and engineers), fostering a fast-paced, “can-do” culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At our heart, we define ourselves by a culture of ownership, intellectual curiosity, and cooperation. &lt;strong&gt;We are looking for driven, capable talents who bring strong motivation and curiosity for new challenges.&lt;/strong&gt; You are a true team player, eager to support others while scaling both the company and your own career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; You have approximately 5-8 years of full-time working experience in top-tier management consulting, technology consulting, or strategic corporate in-house roles. A proven track record of successfully leading and delivering data, analytics, or AI-driven transformation projects is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transformation &amp;amp; Change Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience leading complex, cross-functional transformation programs, with the ability to manage executive stakeholders, navigate corporate politics, and embed AI capabilities within client organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Fluency &amp;amp; &quot;Builder Mindset&quot;:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong fluency in modern and applied AI (e.g., GenAI, LLMs, agentic systems, automated workflows). While you don&#39;t need to be a full-time programmer, you have a hands-on understanding and can credibly demo working AI concepts and discuss data privacy and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Technical Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge about common machine learning techniques, cloud architectures, and data management principles. Excellent quantitative skills to draw strategic insights from complex data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding communication, presentation, and moderation skills. You have a strong presence and can translate complex technical topics into compelling arguments for non-technical senior executives, as well as bridge the gap to technical execution teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent academic track record with a Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Business Administration, Economics, Computer Science, Business Informatics, Physics, Mathematics, or a comparable quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Business-fluency in both German and English (written and spoken) is mandatory to successfully advise our German clients and lead workshops. Additional languages are a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; A valid work permit for Germany.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy with a Data Edge:&lt;/strong&gt; Artefact sits uniquely at the crossroads of top-tier business strategy and deep tech. You will build boardroom-level strategy expertise while staying at the absolute forefront of AI, data management, and digital value creation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Entrepreneurial Freedom:&lt;/strong&gt; As part of a fast-growing team in Germany, you will have high visibility from day one. You will directly help shape Artefact&#39;s footprint in the region, bringing in your own ideas and driving business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Learning:&lt;/strong&gt; Constant exposure to new AI solutions at the intersection of technology and business. Access to regular training in both strategy consulting methodologies and the latest AI/data capabilities through our global network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture of Doers:&lt;/strong&gt; We combine a high degree of self-assurance with a supportive, collaborative environment. We are entrepreneurial, fast-moving, and committed to delivering real impact - while strongly supporting each other&#39;s personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Berlin or Munich.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Don&#39;t worry if you don&#39;t meet all the criteria!&lt;/strong&gt; At Artefact, we value motivation, pragmatic problem-solving, and potential above all else.If you are excited about shaping the future of AI and ready to make a real impact, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion at Artefact&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;gt; &lt;em&gt;We believe that unique perspectives fuel innovation. At Artefact, we are committed to creating an inclusive environment where everyone can thrive. We welcome and consider all applications purely based on merit, skills, and potential - regardless of gender identity, sexual orientation, race, ethnicity, religion, age, background, or disability. Come as you are!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the next step?&lt;/strong&gt; Please submit your CV showcasing your experience and passion for this role as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting Manager (m/f/d) Data &amp;amp; AI Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;. We look forward to receiving your application!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to send us a message at -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Remote is solving modern organizations’ biggest challenge – navigating global employment compliantly with ease. We make it possible for businesses of all sizes to recruit, pay, and manage international teams. With our core values at heart and future focused work culture, our team works tirelessly on ambitious problems, asynchronously, around the world. You can find Remoters working from 6 different continents (Antarctica left to go!) and all of our positions are fully remote.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-id-2f7cb4da-dab4-8068-a80f-001c50b2d808 suggestion-update notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;With Innovation as one of the core values, we have built Automation and AI capabilities into the requirements for every role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We encourage every member of the Remote team to bring their talents, experiences and culture to the table to help us build the best-in-class HR platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you are energetic, curious, motivated and ambitious, be part of our world. Apply now and define the future of work!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a senior partnerships leader to own the commercial success and ongoing relationship with a portfolio of Remote’s most strategic embedded partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person will be responsible for driving bookings &amp;amp; ARR across partner-sold and partner-sourced motions (quota carrying). They will own the revenue line for these partnerships and will be accountable for making the partnerships successful commercially, operationally, and strategically.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role sits at the intersection of partner relationship management, sales leadership, go-to-market execution, and cross-functional orchestration. The primary focus is commercial: helping partners generate demand, enable their sellers, close deals, improve conversion, and build repeatable motions that allow them to sell Remote products increasingly independently. At the same time, this person will be the senior relationship owner for the partner, responsible for partnership health, executive engagement, issue resolution, and long-term expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a “manage the partner relationship and hope revenue follows” role. It is a commercial leadership role where the partnership relationship exists in service of revenue growth, partner independence, and long-term embedded success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptionally sharp business judgement. You can understand the business objectives and stakeholder dynamics of a complex partner organization, and translate that to concrete actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator and evangelist. You can create and consistently communicate the partnership value message within the partner organization and Remote.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operating rigor: you can turn ambiguity into repeatable plans, cadences, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence: you feel comfortable dealing with C-level execs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dare to dive deep: you operate cross-functionally with ease; you don’t shy away from detailed discussions with product, engineering, legal or compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deal maker: you create proposals ‘you can say yes to’ that create long term sustainable economics for both parties. You are able to be firm when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage through influence: you are able to work with large strategic partners where success depends on influencing another company’s sales, marketing, product, and leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, hiring and managing a high-performance team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel 20–40%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning revenue motions and owning a number. You own outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in top-tier consulting, finance, or big tech - and in B2B tech startups/scaleups. You have the big and the small.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating new businesses, product, or sales motion. You build new systems, don’t just operate within them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus points for experience in HR Tech, Fin Tech, or Embedded partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own commercial outcomes for strategic embedded partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio of Remote’s largest embedded HR technology partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry an annual bookings target of $10M+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for the commercial performance of the partnership, including pipeline generation, conversion, bookings, ARR, ASP, retention, and expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute partner account plans that translate strategic partnership potential into measurable revenue outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify where revenue is blocked, where and why performance is below potential, and what needs to change across partner GTM, Remote GTM, product, process, enablement, pricing, or operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage commercial exceptions, pricing escalations, deal support, and channel conflicts where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Make partners independently successful&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help partner sellers become increasingly independent in generating, qualifying, selling, and closing Remote opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build repeatable partner sales motions across partner-sold, partner-sourced, and co-sold opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with partner sales leaders to embed Remote into their teams’ priorities, workflows, sales processes, and incentives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with enablement, solutions consulting, partner marketing, and embedded sales teams to ensure partner sellers know what to sell, how to sell it, and when to bring Remote in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a clear path from Remote-supported selling to partner-led selling, with the goal of reducing unnecessary dependency on Remote while improving commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead senior partner relationships&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the overall relationship health with strategic embedded partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior / C-level stakeholders within the partner organization across sales, marketing, product, operations, and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep partners engaged, motivated, and accountable to the joint commercial plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unblock issues that slow down revenue growth or damage partner confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run structured business reviews with clear performance insights, decisions, next steps, and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the partner sees Remote as a critical strategic partner, not just another integration or referral option.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Define the embedded partner GTM model across the partner portfolio&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, test, and optimize sales motions across partner-sold, partner-sourced, and co-sold models. Turn successful experiments into repeatable playbooks that can be used across partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create playbooks for demand generation, enablement, sales process, partner seller activation, deal support, QBRs, and partner performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and influence partners to implement best practices for demand generation and embedded sales in their own organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify friction between channels and work with Sales, Partnerships, RevOps, and leadership to resolve it. Share learnings so that Remote gets better with every partnership, not just within one account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to expand existing embedded partnerships into new products, markets, customer segments, regions, or sales motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Manage and develop a high performing team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a team of partner account managers and embedded sales leads supporting the partner portfolio. Set clear priorities, operating rhythms, and performance expectations for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach the team to balance short-term deal support with the longer-term goal of making partner sellers more independent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Orchestrate Remote cross-functionally&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the commercial and relationship orchestrator across Remote for the partner portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product, Solution Architecture, Partner Marketing, Solutions Consulting, Legal, Compliance, Operations, CX, Implementation, RevOps, and Partner Success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure internal stakeholders understand the commercial priorities, partner context, trade-offs, and urgency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate clearly when decisions, resources, product changes, or executive support are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Practicals&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Remote Embedded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting line:&lt;/strong&gt; GM Remote Embedded&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; North America or Western Europe. The best timezones for this role are US Eastern Time or UK time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; 20–40% within North America and Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; As soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roughly 3 hours across 4 weeks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with recruiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with future manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview with team members (no managers present)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Veremark-Remote-96e108c037b8423cbd4c3f07a1f9b38b?d=41ac176d9f0f490b83d7bf56dcd5bf11#aeb36272c9bd49b1b490f2ae7fc76552&quot;&gt;Prior employment verification check&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Remote&#39;s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/people-Total-Rewards-1945bce8d3924ece9421ba8630f57b0c&quot;&gt;Total Rewards philosophy&lt;/a&gt; is to ensure fair, unbiased compensation and fair &lt;span class=&quot;link-annotation-unknown-block-id-1691622878&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;discussion-level-1 discussion-id-f2a82bc4-09e4-4a71-ad93-755b1d26a690 notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt; pay &lt;/span&gt;along with competitive benefits in all locations in which we operate. We do not agree to or encourage cheap-labor practices and therefore we ensure to pay above in-location rates. We hope to inspire other companies to support global talent-hiring and bring local wealth to developing countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At first glance our salary bands seem quite wide - here is some context. At Remote we have international operations and a globally distributed workforce.&amp;nbsp; We use geo ranges to consider geographic pay differentials as part of our global compensation strategy to remain competitive in various markets while we hiring globally.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our salary ranges are determined by role, level and location, and our job titles may span more than one career level. The actual base pay for the successful candidate in this role is dependent upon many factors such as location, transferable or job-related skills, work experience, relevant training, business needs, and market demands. The base salary range may be subject to change.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;At Remote, we foster internal mobility as a key element of our culture of employee growth and development, supported by a compensation philosophy that guarantees pay equity and fairness. Therefore, all compensation changes associated with an internal move will be reviewed by the Total Rewards &amp;amp; People Enablement team on a case by case basis.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual salary range for this full-time position is&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$252,050&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$425,300 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our full benefits &amp;amp; perks are explained in our handbook at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://remote.com/r/benefits&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;remote.com/r/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. As a global company, each country works differently, but some benefits/perks are for all Remoters:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;work from anywhere&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;flexible paid time off&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;flexible working hours (we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://remote.com/async&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.notion.so/remotecom/Working-Async-at-Remote-80c01cd443ad4c77a8ceaef7c5fba5d0&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;async&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
