&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Media Futures Group:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Media Futures Group (MFG) is a bespoke team within WPP that delivers on our commitment to Google for a more strategic, creative and integrated media approach established to drive better business results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The MFG team is made up of best in class digital, offline, and integrated media experts who work together to enhance media’s contribution to Google’s business. MFG is powered by WPP Media and other constituent parts of the WPP network around the world. The MFG team operates in a seamlessly integrated way across strategy, planning, investment, creative, production, business sciences and analytics, data and technology. The profile of people who work in MFG are world class, committed to establishing a new high water mark in the media industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MFG is committed to the growth of our people as a means to unleash the potential of Google’s business. We are invested in whole-person wellbeing, values and behaviors that reflect our mission and purpose, and providing the tools and systems needed to do the best work of your career. This is a team empowered by limitless possibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role / Some of the things we’d like you to do&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is a team leader within the newly formed Global Applied Transformation function on MFG.&amp;nbsp; The Applied Transformation function is responsible for implementing large-scale, global changes as we partner with Google to radically transform marketing in an AI-fueled, data-driven, rapidly changing environment. The Program and Change management team is also responsible for leading projects / programs essential to day-to-day excellence and execution.&amp;nbsp; This role will be responsible for a team of Project / Program managers as well as creating a change management / communications capability.&amp;nbsp; As the program and change management lead, you will wear many hats…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As leader for the project and program managers team you will…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide direct line management, mentorship and coaching to project managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define project management competency models and performance expectations across career stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a strategic direction for the project / program management discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish agile / adaptable standards and best practices for project and program management&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a leader for a cadre of change managers you will…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish agile / adaptable standards and best practices for change management and communications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong working relationships with Global Functional leads, Global POD leads and Regional leads to understand nuances and unique requirements across operational units that impact adoption and engagement.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a holistic change management / communications roadmap across transformation workstreams and BAU initiatives to ensure methods and approaches are designed to drive successful engagement and adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;To achieve the above, maintain a “think global, act local” perspective. We should strive for consistency across regions, yet relevance in markets is mission critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where appropriate, partner with the Talent team to leverage tools and expertise to support change journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with key stakeholders and practitioners to proactively identify the impacts and effects of transformation initiatives. As part of this, provide a lens that considers our full organization at all levels and areas of specialism&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge the status quo to ensure transformation initiatives are aligned to strategic priorities / objectives and driving step change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a facilitator and collaborator you will…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong working relationship across the WPP network and MFG team to ensure visibility, clarity, progress and strategic alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across workstreams, projects and programs to solve unexpected issues, facilitating collaboration to stay-on track and removal of barriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect the dots as needed across concurrent transformation initiatives to ensure dependencies and interlocks are addressed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with partners in Talent, Operations, and Finance to share context and operate in lock step with our business and people priorities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About yourself / Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project &amp;amp; Program Management / Process Design / Change Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on, roll-your-sleeves up, can-do leader who’s comfortable setting the vision, getting into the details, and able to connect the dots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quintessential project and program planner who can plot the course from start to finish, anticipate and plan for risks, seamlessly shift between the strategic and tactical, and course correct as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience operating at a Director level&amp;nbsp; in a consulting / management consulting organization focused on transformation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SME level analytical and problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert process documentation, design and optimization skills working in conjunction with functional experts and practitioners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert level change management skills - understands various change management approaches / methodologies, able to create change strategy, identify audiences and personas, create / curate required artifacts, drive and track adoption / impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept coach and mentor for Project / Program and Change managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communications and collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable having tough conversations with key stakeholders (internal and external)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written / verbal communication and storytelling skills including ability to tailor messages based on audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at conflict resolution and driving through conflicting priorities across diverse stakeholder groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fosters an environment of inclusive collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifelong learner / innovator / early adopter mindset&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at learning new technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem identifier and solver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embraces the opportunity to identify ways to leverage AI, automation and technology solutions to improve processes, drive efficiency and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops a deep understanding of Google’s business&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and breaking down complex problems into simple solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2900 – Data Engineer - GCS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media Global Client Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media&#39;s Global client teams are organised within a centralised squad based in London.&amp;nbsp; A critical part of that is the WPP Media Global &#39;Strategy and Capabilities&#39; team - a unit of 160 specialists focused on industry leading Strategic Planning, Insights and Innovation, working across WPP&#39;s global clients including Nestlé, Coca Cola, Danone, Unilever, AirBnB, Ford, Adidas, IKEA, L&#39;Oreal and more. We operate at the forefront of the industry, collaborating seamlessly across WPP&#39;s ecosystem of experts to deliver integrated strategies and drive tangible business outcomes. We believe in the power of media to transform businesses and connect deeply with consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is looking for a Data Engineer with interest in machine learning (ML) engineering, as well as the productionisation and optimization of ML models to join our Global Data Strategy &amp;amp; Insights team.&amp;nbsp; While operating within our team you will be asked to use our proprietary and/or client data along with ML techniques to help answer client questions around audiences like: ‘which audience should I be advertising to?’, ‘how should my strategy be different when approaching this audience?’, ‘how is does my media plan need to change across geographies?’. You will also be assisting our team in developing products to help both our global and local teams with day-to-day media planning. This reaches from hypothesis testing, data experiments, and predictive and prescriptive analysis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will have the opportunity to collaborate with other data scientists and engineers (e.g. in our Analytics team) with experience and expertise in a wide range of methodologies, toolkits and applications to a variety of problems in the media landscape. This reaches from data engineering, setting and defining best practices and scaling ML POCs. You will also be collaborating with strategists, insights specialists and non-technical stakeholders to ensure the data structures align with the client use case and specifications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate would be curious, flexible and passionate about using data science/ML as a tool to understand human behaviour, campaign effectiveness and business dynamics. We are a data agnostic team that believe the key to success is not just having access to different types of data (market research, surveys, online behavioural panels, site data, targeted web-scraping) but finding new, innovative ways to connect and analyse the data we have access to, to deliver real, actionable, insight for our clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key responsibilities for this position include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using data engineering techniques to clean, process and re-format large volumes of data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing coding changes to our existing tools to improve them or adapt them for different use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing functionalities of our various tools and providing feedback on improvements that can be implemented.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting our Fusion Data Scientist in preparing different types of data for data fusion (incl. mapping variables, recoding data etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing checks on survey data and preparing data for trend analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain a number of our Python packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ingesting survey data into different tools to be used for insights, planning, modelling and reporting (both WPP Media and WPP Data Tech Solutions )&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting in the development of new products/tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, flexibility, problem solving skills, a scientific mindset and an enthusiasm for learning new things are key attributes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fundamentally interested in people - Interested in the world around you and what makes people behave the way they do and how data and research can get you closer to understanding it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work well as part of a team – you understand that one person can’t do or know everything and so you are willing to explore alternative routes, even if they are outside your comfort zone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast learner, with the ability to work across multiple workstreams at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited by telling stories from information by weaving different sources together into a convincing whole.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to think critically and with curiosity about information sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to manage multiple stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills we need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and statistical knowledge, as well as interest in applying them to complex problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competent with Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable manipulating and reshaping data to suit a particular task or tale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to communicate ideas well, both verbally and written to both technical and non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cloud computing (desirable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of docker (desirable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to SQL, R, SPSS or other programming languages (desirable)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at WPP Media &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;nbsp;Create an Open environment&amp;nbsp;built on trust and respect, where everyone feels they belong and has opportunities to progress. This inclusive culture is fostered through a variety of employee resource groups and frequent in-office events&amp;nbsp;showcasing&amp;nbsp;team wins, sharing thought leadership, and celebrating holidays and milestone events. Our comprehensive benefits package reflects this commitment, including competitive medical, group retirement plans, vision, and dental insurance, significant paid time off, preferential partner discounts, and employee mental health awareness days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We believe the best work happens when&amp;nbsp;we&#39;re&amp;nbsp;together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection in this open and supportive environment.&amp;nbsp;That&#39;s&amp;nbsp;why&amp;nbsp;we’ve&amp;nbsp;adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you&amp;nbsp;require&amp;nbsp;accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&amp;nbsp; Please note that while our philosophy is the same across WPP, benefits may vary by office/country.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note this is a UK based role and requires individuals to have the right to work in this location&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy)&lt;/a&gt; for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we appreciate all applications received, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
