&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1621qdr&quot; data-start=&quot;3077&quot; data-end=&quot;3158&quot;&gt;Don&#39;t want to work on your birthday? We don&#39;t either! Enjoy your day off on us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hezlgt&quot; data-start=&quot;3159&quot; data-end=&quot;3230&quot;&gt;Enhanced maternity and paternity pay, depending on length of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jpyk5h&quot; data-start=&quot;3231&quot; data-end=&quot;3267&quot;&gt;Up to 10 days compassionate leave.&lt;/li&gt;
